<title>NEW ZEALAND: CRICKET-SCOREBOARD ON 5TH DAY OF ENGLAND-NZ TEST.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SCOREBOARD ON 5TH DAY OF ENGLAND-NZ TEST.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the fifth day of</p>
<p>the second cricket test between New Zealand and England on</p>
<p>Monday.</p>
<p>New Zealand first innings 124</p>
<p>England first innings 383</p>
<p>New Zealand second innings (overnight 125 for four wickets)</p>
<p> B.Pocock c Knight b Gough	     64</p>
<p> B.Young c Stewart b Tufnell	   56</p>
<p> A.Parore lbw b Croft		    15</p>
<p> S.Fleming c and b Croft		  0</p>
<p> D.Patel lbw b Croft			0</p>
<p> L.Germon b Gough			  11</p>
<p> N.Astle c Stewart b Gough		4</p>
<p> C.Cairns c Knight b Caddick	   22</p>
<p> S.Doull c Knight b Gough		 0</p>
<p> G.Allott b Caddick			 2</p>
<p> D.Vettori not out			  2</p>
<p> Extras (nb-6, lb-4, b-5)		15</p>
<p> Total					191</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-89 2-125 3-125 4-125 5-161 6-164 7-175</p>
<p>8-175 9-182</p>
<p>Bowling: Cork 10-1-42-0 wkts (nb-2), Caddick 27.2-11-40-2,</p>
<p>Croft 20-9-19-3 (nb-1), Gough 23-9-52-4, Tufnell 23-9-29-1</p>
<p>(nb-3).</p>
<p>Result: England won by an innings and 68 runs.</p>
<p>Man of the match: G Thorpe (England).</p>
</text>
